        -> Parallel table scan on vtb  (cost=2.6..2.6 rows=0.25)
            -> Materialize  (cost=0.1..0.1 rows=1)
                -> Limit/Offset: 1/1 row(s)  (cost=0..0 rows=1)
                    -> Rows fetched before execution  (cost=0..0 rows=2)

